      "commit": "453f6f518015dc00b1d0eb716182f94ed31005f5",
      "title": "Keep the shortcut settings changed in Steam",
      "summary": "Change an added game's shortcut in Steam's Properties (Target, Start In, launch options, name), exit Steam and open it again: the paths and name are back to what DroidDeck wrote.",
      "publishedAt": 1791380352000
    },
    {
      "commit": "6d0484941e19b1769f21b488dec52071274d3872",
      "title": "Make Games folders Steam libraries and skip the zero-filled reservation",
      "summary": "\u2022 Installs to an SD card or USB drive sat at Reserving space (#186, and the reservation stall in #164). Steam preallocates every download, and Android's FUSE storage refuses fallocate, so Steam falls back to ftruncate:\n\u2022 exFAT zero-fills the whole file through FUSE before the download starts. SteamWorld Dig took about 3.5 minutes just to reserve.\n\u2022 NTFS answers EPERM, and Steam cancels the install",
      "publishedAt": 1791380314000
    },
    {
      "commit": "cf4791088194de6d981d323e12fcf9f34e830361",
      "title": "File manager: the Linux system's root under Storage",
      "summary": "The file manager's Storage list (the left rail and the drive drop-down) gets a Linux system entry that opens the root of the Linux system the sessions run in: the app's files/linuxfs, which the desktop sees as /.",
      "publishedAt": 1791375409000
    },
    {
      "commit": "a78d5cb600d3ffd24c0352b7aa696af1d633148c",
      "title": "Let Steam draw at the session's full size above 1080p",
      "summary": "Fixes the 1080p preset and Match screen coming up 16:9 on panels wider than 16:9 (2340x1080 reported on Discord; #309 has 1080p and Match screen \"stuck at 1920x1080\").",
      "publishedAt": 1791374345000
    },
    {
      "commit": "206c8a88462a7400635c24b8de53dc8b34454b50",
      "title": "Add Steam background download mode",
      "summary": "Adds an opt-in Steam background-download toggle. It allows active Steam downloads to continue while DroidDeck is hidden or the screen is off, without introducing a separate suspend policy.",
      "publishedAt": 1791369808000
    },
    {
      "commit": "bf17ce1151e76c9f134200b02c13180af2ab5b00",
      "title": "fix: revert gamescope patch 0113 now that games run on their own Xwayland",
      "summary": "Typing does nothing in the text box Steam shows over a game, the \"Please enter text / Submit\" dialog a game opens through Steam's text-input API. This happens with both the Android keyboard and DroidDeck's on-screen keyboard. Typing in Steam's own search bar still works. Reported on a Galaxy Z Fold7 on nightly (two Xwayland servers), with a screen recording and logs.",
      "publishedAt": 1791369101000
    },
    {
      "commit": "ef38c975b994bb131eb327454c836c0ea84efd20",
      "title": "Draw Steam's CJK and Thai text with the device's fonts",
      "summary": "With System default on a phone set to Chinese (also Japanese or Korean), Steam opens in that language, but every character is drawn as a box.",
      "publishedAt": 1791354604000
    },
    {
      "commit": "61953c4f7b11725fb315efa8c10ce2635bdef48d",
      "title": "File manager: up/back from any start folder, plus a \"..\" up row",
      "summary": "Opening the File Manager at a specific folder (a game's Game files button, Proton prefix, the saves folder, or the file picker reopening at its last folder) left you stuck there:\n\u2022 the \u2190 up arrow was greyed out,\n\u2022 the Back gesture closed the screen instead of going up a folder.",
      "publishedAt": 1791346290000
    }
  ],
